                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Look I know this is a game about poop and some people will think yuck, well I beg to differ. Its a fun cute little platformer, where you must guide little Poopie home, and you will encounter obsticals and enemys on each level, you must collect the plunger (key) and the other item Lubricant (spraycan) but the Key (plunger) is most important or you will not make it out alive before time runs out. There are 15 levels and 7 different poopie skins to choose from.\n\nThere are achievements to earn and now Trading cards are available as well.\n\nThe price is fair, but you can always wait for a decent sale if you so wish.\n\nhttp://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=559254845\n\nWhat I would really like to see, given this game is a game about Poopie, is that these developers maybe consider how important poopie is, and that is no laughing matter. But to consider maybe, this is only a consolidated sugestion, is to donate a small percentage of the profits of this game to \" Bowel Cancer research\" and be apart of helping find a cure.\n\nAt the end of the day if you dont poop \" you will die\" and this is no laughing matter. \n\nThis game yes is funny and well cute as well, but also if these developers have a true heart and want to sell this game, I suggest My important sugestion, So please for the sake of lots of people living with Bowel cancer, will you the developers PLEASE consider my suggestion. \n\nI'm glad I bought this game plus 2 more, game is fun btw .:)",
